{"id":"companies-management-by-administrator-rules-1993","pdfOnly":false,"schedules":[{"title":"Annexure","page":3,"text":"Annexure [See rule 4(1)] INFORMATION TO BE SUPPLIED WITH THE REPRESENTATION (1) Name and status of the company ............................................................... (2) Names of the directors at the time of representation ......................................... (3) Name of the chief executive of the company ................................................... (4) Registered office of the company ............................................................... (5) Nature of business of the company .............................................................. (6) Paid-up capital of the company ................................................................. 7. Amount of loans with dates thereof- ........................................................... (i) Long-term loan with rate of mark up ................................................ (ii) Bridging advance with rate of mark up .....................………………. (iii) Working capital loans with rate of mark up .......................................... (iv) Any other loan ............................................................................ 8. Repayment schedule of the respective loans.................................... 9. Repayment made, if any, with their respective dales ......................................... 10. Total amount of outstanding loan with period thereof with percentage of the paid-up capital.......................................................................................... 11. Nature of grievances .............................................................................. 12. Statement and document filed in support of item 10, if any with complete address of the creditors ......................................................................................"}]}